# Laugh API

Welcome to the Laugh API! This simple API provides an endpoint to make you laugh by returning a random joke. 

## Installation

To get started, clone the repository and install the required packages.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/laugh-api.git
cd laugh-api
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Usage

Run the application using:

```bash
python hello.py
```

The API will be available at `http://127.0.0.1:5000/laugh`.

## Endpoints

### GET /laugh

Returns a random joke.

#### Example Response

```json
{
    "joke": "Why don't scientists trust atoms? Because they make up everything!"
}
```

## Running Tests

To run the tests, use:

```bash
pytest tests/
```

